sequenceDiagram
  %% Source for 14-stack-startup-flow.html. Edit this file, then run ./scripts/render-diagrams.py.
  %% Directives: docs in diagrams/README.md (Updating diagrams).
  %% @subtitle One-shot init jobs and health checks that run when a profile starts, in Compose dependency order
  %% @type cloud: DC
  %% @type database: PG OS
  actor OP as Operator
  participant DC as Docker Compose
  participant INIT as One-shot init jobs<br/>exit after setup
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  participant OS as OpenSearch
  participant SVC as Long-running services

  OP->>DC: docker compose --profile prod up
  par search and dashboards
    DC->>INIT: opensearch-certs creates the private CA
    INIT-->>DC: certificates written
    DC->>OS: start OpenSearch
    OS-->>DC: healthy
    DC->>INIT: opensearch-setup provisions users, roles, monitors
    INIT-->>DC: provisioned
    DC->>SVC: start Dashboards, Data Prepper, and bridge
  and database and gateway
    DC->>PG: start postgres
    PG-->>DC: healthy
    DC->>INIT: postgres-init creates litellm_dev
    INIT-->>DC: database ready
    DC->>SVC: start litellm-prod after Presidio is healthy
  and metrics
    DC->>INIT: prometheus-secrets-init copies the metrics key
    INIT-->>DC: key in place
    DC->>SVC: Prometheus starts scraping
  end
  DC-->>OP: stack ready for verification
